    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφιστάνω</span></b> , late form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίστημι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set
				over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.233e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stop, check</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attend to</i> a thing, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.35.6
			</span></i>; <i>consider carefully</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.2.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . , ὅτι</span> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.26.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.18.31
			</span></i>; <i>note</i>, of a commentator, <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in APr.</u>
				68.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>attack</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				795.17
			</span></i>.</div>
